{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 90638, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 63464, "uid": 57, "type": 4, "title": "诸神强袭：炸裂 内容说明", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1635313308, "updated_at": 1636971991, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1663432128, "last_at": 1692524727, "comment_count": 10, "status": 1, "summary": "是否为二级目录：删除诸神强袭：炸裂是在诸神强袭开放期间可以进行挑战的单人副本！请尝试击败最强BOSS吧！是否为二级目录：删除-诸神强袭：炸裂战可在诸神强袭开放期间进行挑战，每击败1次boss即可领取对", "thumb": "https://bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/33hbi5/c_9f0Ud018bng1d4g15hh1l9a_6lwkbv.png?type=w660,https://bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/33hbdg/a_2f0Ud018bng33fxiew6exbu_q4h2sz.png?type=w660,https://bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/33hbhf/7_ff0Ud018bng7y9r583trsrv_ydekrc.png?type=w660", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 4, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 22504, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 3, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 90638, "content": "<div><span style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2021/1635313414_2e2c5a1fdb04d6dc41ef5008c5744c9f.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - 諸神強襲:炸裂內容說明 image 1\" data-v-9daed42e=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;\"><br></span></div><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"诸神强袭：炸裂\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></span></span></div>诸神强袭：炸裂是在诸神强袭开放期间可以进行挑战的单人副本！请尝试击败最强BOSS吧！<br style=\"\"><br><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"何谓诸神强袭：炸裂？\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br style=\"\">-诸神强袭：炸裂战可在诸神强袭开放期间进行挑战，每击败1次boss即可领取对应奖励<br style=\"\">-用来参加炸裂战的票券在使用20张诸神强袭副本券时自动发送1张<br style=\"\">-诸神强袭：炸裂战斗过程中可获得爆发者增益来增加您的战力<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">-开放期间：诸神强袭开放期间内可进行挑战，详细时程请确认每次改版发布的公告<br style=\"\">-挑战方法：消耗1张诸神强袭：炸裂票券即可进行挑战<br style=\"\"><br><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"诸神强袭：炸裂战斗\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br style=\"\">与诸神强袭副本不同，炸裂战为单人进行的挑战活动<br style=\"\">请与您的最佳5人Child一同挑战Boss吧！<br style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2021/1635313414_1621d379a6ff47e2c358e683dd678d39.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - 諸神強襲:炸裂內容說明 image 3\" data-v-9daed42e=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:0px;text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\">※上图为示意图，包含内容可能与实际画面不同<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">-使用20张诸神强袭副本券时自动发送1张诸神强袭：炸裂票券（您也可以在诸神商店中购买额外的票券）<br style=\"\">-参加1次战斗时即消耗1张票券，战斗时间为5分钟<br style=\"\">-未能击败BOSS的状态下结束战斗时，BOSS的残血不会回复。将会维持在最终状态。<br style=\"\">-您可重复挑战BOSS，击败当前等级的BOSS时，即可挑战下一等级的BOSS<br style=\"\">-击败不同等级的BOSS时可领取对应的奖励，请尝试挑战击败最高等级的BOSS吧<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">※装备中针对诸神强袭之加成适用至诸神强袭：炸裂战<br style=\"\">※诸神强袭：炸裂结束后的剩馀票券将以1张=10水晶的价格自动交换<br style=\"\"><br><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"爆发者增益\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br style=\"\">-诸神强袭：炸裂战斗过程中可获得爆发者（Child、魂之歌牌）增益<br style=\"\">-爆发者不会参加战斗，但可提供各自对应的增益<br style=\"\">-不同的爆发者增益可叠加使用，强化各个爆发者（Child&amp;魂之歌牌）可提升加成的幅度<br style=\"\">-爆发者的名单每一季有所不同，可在公告或游戏内进行确认<br style=\"\"><br></span></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">※Child爆发者：根据突破界限、点火等级决定加成的幅度<br style=\"\">※魂之歌牌爆发者：根据灵魂强化决定加成的幅度。<br style=\"\">※Child、魂之歌牌不论现在是否持有，只要曾经持有过即可启用效果<br style=\"\">※爆发者增益启用阶段变化如下，也可以在炸裂战主画面中确认目前启用的效果阶段<br style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2021/1635313415_877d4f07c384890263d99685f89a06e4.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - 諸神強襲:炸裂內容說明 image 5\" data-v-9daed42e=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:0px;text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">▷诸神强袭-&gt;诸神强袭：炸裂&gt;爆发者增益！！<br style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2021/1635313415_c25746eb1cb004e213ec367f2e235a03.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - 諸神強襲:炸裂內容說明 image 7\" data-v-9daed42e=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:0px;text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\">※上图为示意图，包含内容可能与实际画面不同<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">▷诸神强袭-&gt;诸神强袭：炸裂&gt;爆发者增益&gt;说明<br style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2021/1635313415_024a0fe1ca1716009d91d5f7a78e5606.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - 諸神強襲:炸裂內容說明 image 9\" data-v-9daed42e=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:0px;text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"诸神强袭：炸裂战奖励\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br style=\"\">-击败不同等级的BOSS时可领取对应的奖励<br style=\"\">-奖励将会自动发送，您也可以在[诸神强袭：炸裂战-&gt;奖励]中确认详细清单.<br style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2021/1635313416_c4ccda440eb2fb570b378f02fae76927.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - 諸神強襲:炸裂內容說明 image 11\" data-v-9daed42e=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:0px;text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\">※上图为示意图，包含内容可能与实际画面不同</span></span><span style=\"\"></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["https://bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/33hbi5/c_9f0Ud018bng1d4g15hh1l9a_6lwkbv.png?type=w660", "//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/33hbdg/a_2f0Ud018bng33fxiew6exbu_q4h2sz.png?type=w660", "//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/33hbhf/7_ff0Ud018bng7y9r583trsrv_ydekrc.png?type=w660"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 121717662, "content_num": 6190, "read_num": 36421698, "like_num": 17800}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "gam